{"metadata":{"extendedModule":"IvorGMN","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"IvorGMN"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Change","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"GMNNormalizer.Change","externalID":"s:7IvorGMN13GMNNormalizerV6ChangeO","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Change","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","symbolKind":"enum"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/canonicalizedTagName(_:_:)","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/droppedInertParameter(_:_:)","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/droppedParameterUnit(_:_:)","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/droppedRawIdentifierParameter(_:_:)","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/droppedSpanEndParameters(_:)","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/droppedUnacceptedParameters(_:)","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/droppedUnsupportedParameter(_:_:)","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/expandedVariableReference(_:_:)","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/renamedParameter(_:_:_:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","title":"Enumeration Cases"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/message"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/Equatable-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Change","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Two of these fire far less often than they used to","anchor":"Two-of-these-fire-far-less-often-than-they-used-to","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before the typed tag model, normalization was where a tag’s name and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its parameter names were put right, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/canonicalizedTagName(_:_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/renamedParameter(_:_:_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"were reported for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"every","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" tag written with an alias or a deprecated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter name. They are now reported only for a tag that failed to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"promote to a typed payload."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The canonicalization still happens either way — it just usually"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"happens in the parser, where promotion selects the payload and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"payload "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"is","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the canonical identity. A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\bm"},{"type":"text","text":" becomes a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNBeam"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNBeam"},{"type":"text","text":" reports the name "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"beam"},{"type":"text","text":"; there was never an alias"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stored to rewrite. Only a tag promotion rejected — an unknown"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter, a value no field can carry — keeps its written name far"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enough downstream for the normalizer’s fallback table to be the thing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that fixes it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"So a caller that counted these changes to detect “this score used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"short-form tag names” will now see nothing for a score it previously"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reported on. "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The formatted output is unchanged","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\bm"},{"type":"text","text":" still"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"comes out "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\beam"},{"type":"text","text":". What changed is which stage says so, and therefore"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whether it is announced at all."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmnnormalizer\/change"]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"A change applied when normalizing a ","t